        "id": 1000480
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-09-22T15:57:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m surprised we hit this path since WebGPU validation already enforces `rgba` for `RENDER_ATTACHMENT`. Shall I instead go through this path only if `GetInternalUsage() \u0026 wgpu::TextureUsage::RenderAttachment) \u003d\u003d 0` to avoid this? \n\nI don\u0027t understand how specifying `VK_COMPONENT_SWIZZLE_IDENTITY` for all members in that existing case will solve it as the purpose of this CL is to set it to `r001` for depth-stencil.",
      "parentUuid": "ba9f6229_c04b4478",
      "revId": "fe032062c5b812733ac6f4940b2a00731cbf8792",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
